> COMPENSATION, BENEFITS & WORK ENVIRONMENT
> Competitive compensation is targeted to be within the range of $250,000 - $330,000
> annually, commensurate with experience. Comprehensive benefits will be provided including
> medical, dental, and vision coverage; life insurance; a 401(k) retirement savings plan; and
