> The position is primarily remote/virtual with in-person meetings generally twice a year in the
> U.S., plus periodic travel for grantee site visits and convenings/conferences for learning and
> relationship-building. The Executive Director must be flexible to work across time zones.
> THE APPLICATION
> The Hopper-Dean Family Foundation is partnering with Walker & Associates Consulting – a
> Black- and woman-owned strategic management consulting and executive search firm
